{"q":"543","t":"Diameter of Binary Tree","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>root</code> of a binary tree, return <em>the length of the <strong>diameter</strong> of the tree</em>.</p>\n\n<p>The <strong>diameter</strong> of a binary tree is the <strong>length</strong> of the longest path between any two nodes in a tree. This path may or may not pass through the <code>root</code>.</p>\n\n<p>The <strong>length</strong> of a path between two nodes is represented by the number of edges between them.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/941def7049c9c18f.jpg\" style=\"width: 292px; height: 302px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [1,2,3,4,5]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> 3 is the length of the path [4,2,1,3] or [5,2,1,3].\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [1,2]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[1, 10<sup>4</sup>]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"diameterOfBinaryTree\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"root\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"},{"name":"DP on Trees","slug":"dp-on-trees"}],"s":[{"t":"Diameter of N-Ary Tree","s":"diameter-of-n-ary-tree","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Longest Path With Different Adjacent Characters","s":"longest-path-with-different-adjacent-characters","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Meta","facebook"],["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Nutanix","nutanix"],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Flipkart","flipkart"],["Visa","visa"],["DE Shaw","de-shaw"],["tcs","tcs"],["Verkada","verkada"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Wix","wix"]]}